{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-10-2-2:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_10_2_2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-10-2-2:p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究者报告严重不良事件（SAE）应遵循现行适用的法律法规、伦理委员会要求及方案规定。研究者应在首次获知 SAE 后立即向申办者或其委托的药物警戒/安全报告接收部门书面报告，且不迟于 24 小时；对于致死或危及生命的 SAE，应立即报告。研究者还应按要求向临床试验机构、伦理委员会报告。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-10-2-2:p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本节报告时限以研究者首次获知严重不良事件（SAE）的日期和时间作为起算点。研究者报告时钟独立于申办者加速报告时钟，不得将单一报告时钟复制到研究者与申办者两侧；签署或受理表不得推迟基于首次获知事实的报告，也不得作为报告时限的起算点；不得以模板示例替代本节项目规则。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-10-2-2:p3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究者应在原始医疗记录和病例报告表（CRF/eCRF）中记录 SAE 的完整信息，包括事件描述、起止时间、严重性标准、处理措施、转归、因果关系评估、报告日期和接收方。记录应与向申办者、临床试验机构及伦理委员会的报告保持一致，并可支持对报告时限自首次获知起算的核查。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"bda32e8303ff8d3dcad9489799468771b985cdac601e005ccc7f233b365a2315"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:809a7edcd245ea82a73b79a4a70f2a9e18319791e751b9d3afe0df8f475e5dc0:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:809a7edcd245ea82a73b79a4a70f2a9e18319791e751b9d3afe0df8f475e5dc0:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"8f08d8fe5fff0970f2f6f6a7433d981ab46427abd4bb9d1044cf9534da214720","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"acf5725f-7225-4d4c-b64f-c1c28233ba91","requested_reasoning_ef